\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</csobj></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"top\"><img src=\"../../images/bh-links/details.gif\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-links/details.gif\" width=\"144\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\" alt=\"briefings details\"></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"black\" height=\"602\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" height=\"382\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"75%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"382\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><span class=\"textred12\"><font color=\"red\"><b>Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings and Training</b></font><font color=\"white\"><br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</font></span>Marina Mandarin Hotel, Singapore</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Training\" href=\"train-bh-asia-03-index.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/train-bh-asia-03-index.html\">Training:</a></b></font><font color=\"white\"> 16-17 December 2003<br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</font><font color=\"red\"><b>Briefings:</b></font><font color=\"white\"> 18-19 December 2003<br />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</font><b><font color=\"red\"><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Exhibition\" href=\"bh-asia-03-exhibition.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-exhibition.html\">Exhibition:</a> </font></b>18-19 December 2003</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Registration\" href=\"bh-asia-03-registration.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-registration.html\">Black Hat Asia 2003 Registration</a></b> now open.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings Schedule\" href=\"bh-asia-03-schedule.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-schedule.html\">Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings Schedule.</a></b></font><font color=\"white\"> There will be 2 different tracks over 2 days comprised of renown local and international speakers. Keynote Speakers will be </font><font color=\"yellow\"><a href=\"bh-asia-03-speakers.html#Ming\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-speakers.html#Ming\">Mr. Lim Khee Ming,</a></font> <span class=\"textgold10\">Deputy General Manager (Technology &amp; Operations) Network for Electronic Transfers (S) Pte Ltd (NETS) and <a title=\"Harry SK Tan,\" href=\"bh-asia-03-speakers.html#Tan\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-speakers.html#Tan\">Mr. Harry SK Tan,</a><b> </b>Director, Centre for Asia Pacific Technology Law &amp; Policy (CAPTEL) </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\">Selected </font><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings Speakers\" href=\"bh-asia-03-speakers.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-speakers.html\">Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings Speakers.</a> </b></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\">Selected </font><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Training\" href=\"train-bh-asia-03-index.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/train-bh-asia-03-index.html\">Black Hat Asia 2003 Training.</a> </b></font>Several new courses will be offered.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"white\">See who our current </font><b><font color=\"red\"><a href=\"bh-asia-03-sponsors.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsors.html\">Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings Sponsors are.</a></font></b><font color=\"red\"> </font>Get information   on <a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Sponsor Information\" href=\"../../images/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsor.pdf\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsor.pdf\"><b>Asia 2003 sponsorship opportunities.</b></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"red\"><b><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings and Training Hotel and Venue\" href=\"bh-asia-03-venue.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-venue.html\">Hotel &amp; Venue</a></b> </font><font color=\"white\">information for Black Hat Asia 2003 Briefings and Training.</font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"white\" face=\"Arial,Helvetica\" size=\"3\"></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td rowspan=\"3\" bgcolor=\"white\" valign=\"top\" height=\"602\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Sponsors\" href=\"bh-asia-03-sponsors.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsors.html\"><img src=\"../../images/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsor.gif\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsor.gif\" alt=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Sponsors\" height=\"75\" width=\"175\" border=\"0\"></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span class=\"textblack8\">Paid delegates* will receive a copy of <i><a title=\"Hack Proofing Your Network, Second Edition\" href=\"javascript:if(confirm('http://www.syngress.com/catalog/sg_main.cfm?pid=1942  \\n\\nThis file was not retrieved by Teleport Ultra, because it is addressed on a domain or path outside the boundaries set for its Starting Address.  \\n\\nDo you want to open it from the server?'))window.location='http://www.syngress.com/catalog/sg_main.cfm?pid=1942'\" tppabs=\"http://www.syngress.com/catalog/sg_main.cfm?pid=1942\">&quot;Hack Proofing Your Network, Second Edition&quot;</a> </i>compliments of Syngress, our official book sponsor. </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span class=\"textblack8\"><img src=\"../../images/bh-sponsors/syngress-90px.gif\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-sponsors/syngress-90px.gif\" alt=\"\" height=\"23\" width=\"90\" border=\"0\"></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"black\"><span class=\"textblack8\">Black Hat welcomes ACW as the official publisher.</span></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img src=\"../../images/bh-sponsors/ACW-75.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-sponsors/ACW-75.jpg\" alt=\"ACW - Official Publisher\" height=\"19\" width=\"75\" border=\"0\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"black\"><span class=\"textblack8\">The Marina Mandarin is the official conference hotel.</span></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img src=\"../../images/bh-asia-03/MMSNEW2C-65px.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-asia-03/MMSNEW2C-65px.jpg\" alt=\"\" height=\"53\" width=\"65\" border=\"0\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textblack8\">Learn about <a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Sponsor Information\" href=\"../../images/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsor.pdf\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-sponsor.pdf\">Asia 2003 sponsorship opportunities.</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span class=\"textblack8\">Wireless internet access is available during the show. Bring your 802.11b cards.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textblack8\"><img src=\"../../images/bh-media/wifi_icon-45px.gif\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-media/wifi_icon-45px.gif\" alt=\"\" height=\"32\" width=\"45\" border=\"0\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" height=\"12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"75%\" valign=\"top\" height=\"12\"><img src=\"../../images/bh-links/specialevents-grn.jpg\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/images/bh-links/specialevents-grn.jpg\" alt=\"Special Events\" height=\"12\" width=\"103\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" height=\"122\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td bgcolor=\"black\" valign=\"top\" width=\"75%\" height=\"122\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\">Black Hat <a title=\"Black Hat Asia Capture the Flag\" href=\"bh-asia-03-ctf.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-ctf.html\"><b>Capture the Flag</b></a><b> </b>- see how you can participate, what you can win and the complete rules. <i><font color=\"#adff2f\">Note: only 50 seats are available.</font> <font color=\"#adff2f\">To assure a seat for the CtF, email singapore at theyorkgroup.com</font></i></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\">First ever <a title=\"Black Hat Asia 2003 Exhibition\" href=\"bh-asia-03-exhibition.html\" tppabs=\"https://www.blackhat.com/html/bh-asia-03/bh-asia-03-exhibition.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Hat Asia Exhibition:</b></a> The Most Advanced Security Related Products &amp; Solutions Will Be Showcased In This Year's Black Hat Asia! </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"textwhite8\"><font color=\"red\"><b>Complete the Feedback Forms!</b></font> Delegates who turn in completed Feedback Forms will be entered into a lucky draw to win:</p>\n\t\t